cn":"你不应该再唱那些歌了，<style=stress><p...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x59E9E3FBCB11D571","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그 노래는 부르면 안 돼요, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","female":"그 노래는 부르면 안 돼요, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","variant_male_record_index":"219807","variant_female_record_index":"219808","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1660218004:0":{"text":"그 노래는 파괴를 불러올 뿐이에요, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","source_cn":"那些歌声会带来破坏，<style=stress><pl...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x45D0E1229B36BC1E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그 노래는 파괴를 불러올 뿐이에요, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","female":"그 노래는 파괴를 불러올 뿐이에요, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","variant_male_record_index":"219809","variant_female_record_index":"219810","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1660218005:0":{"text":"파괴를 불러온 건 당신들이잖아요! 저희를 이 터무니없는 꿈속에 가둔 것도 당신들이고요!","source_cn":"带来破坏的，明明是你们！是你们把我们弄进了这场荒诞的梦里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D84246CE6557182","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1660218006:0":{"text":"많은 이들이 꿈속의 저주에 걸렸습니다. 솔직히 말하자면, 이건 결코 선의에서 나온 행동처럼 보이지 않는군요.","source_cn":"许多人因此感染上了那些梦境里的诅咒，恕我直言，这并不像...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE526AA6089F5333C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1660218007:0":{"text":"꿈은 곧 보호에요. 여러분은 모르겠지만요.","source_cn":"梦境是一种保护，你们不懂。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3C461D0892CB918","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1660218008:0":{"text":"꿈속의 저주는 해를 끼치지 않아요. 여러분은 모르겠지만요.","source_cn":"梦里的诅咒没有伤害，你们不懂。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E19793826985272","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1660218008":{"text":"꿈속의 저주는 해를 끼치지 않아요. 여러분은 모르겠지만요.","source_cn":"梦里的诅咒没有伤害，你们不懂。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E19793826985272","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1660218009:1":{"text":"안전을 위해서 꿈을 만들었어요. 꼭 필요한 일이었죠.","source_cn":"我们制造梦境，是出于安全起见，这是必要的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x519BB5FE36937BBA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1660218010:1":{"text":"모두의 꿈으로 찾아온 악몽에 맞설 수 있으니까요. 꼭 필요한 일이었죠.","source_cn":"梦魇来了，众人的梦境能抵御梦魇，这是必要的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BDF46382F536983","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1660218010":{"text":"모두의 꿈으로 찾아온 악몽에 맞설 수 있으니까요. 꼭 필요한 일이었죠.","source_cn":"梦魇来了，众人的梦境能抵御梦魇，这是必要的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BDF46382F536983","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1660218011:1":{"text":"아로라가 잠들어 있어서 힘을 조금 빌렸어요.","source_cn":"奥萝拉睡着了，我们借来了一点力量。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8B835861EBAC440","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1660218012:1":{"text":"다들 꿈속에 있으면 싸우지 않아도 돼요!","source_cn":"大家只要在梦里，就不会再有纷争！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CC17E103E3E919F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1660218013:0":{"text":"그러니까 다 같이 꿈을 꿔요!","source_cn":"所以，一起做梦吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B041ED87E6621AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1660218014:0":{"text":"아름다운 꿈이 이어지면 영원히 안전하니까요!","source_cn":"美梦不断，永远安全！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EE4C8690FC100FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1660218015:0":{"text":"정말 황당하네요. 아버지도, 상회도 제가 없으면 안 된다고요. 전 돌아가야겠어요!","source_cn":"这太荒唐了，我必须回去，父亲和商会不能没有我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F7086CF7ADC47D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1660218016:0":{"text":"또다시 끝없이 이어질 시간이 싫긴 하지만, 그래도 꾸며 낸 허무에 빠지는 것보단 낫지요.","source_cn":"虽然我厌弃这无穷无尽的岁月，但也好过沉溺于编造出来的虚无。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA97434DA0FBE8F09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1660218017:0":{"text":"저, 저도 땅거미 숲으로 돌아가서 계속 모두를 돕고 싶어요!","source_cn":"我、我想回薄暮丛林，继续帮助大家！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2496889A050776A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1660218018:0":{"text":"돌려보내 줘.","source_cn":"让我回去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA79F654C254FB7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:30:1660218018":{"text":"돌려보내 줘.","source_cn":"让我回去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA79F654C254FB7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1660218019:0":{"text":"싫어요!","source_cn":"不要！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF72A0103D234782","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1660218020:0":{"text":"싫어요!","source_cn":"不要！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA526C7EEB4BAA303","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1660218021:0":{"text":"꿈속에서는 새로운 신분도, 새로운 친구도 있어요. 재미있잖아요.","source_cn":"你们在梦境里有新的身份和新的朋友，这很有趣。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC353F28D903A049D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1660218022:0":{"text":"꿈속에서는 다투더라도 아무도 다치지 않아요. 평화롭잖아요.","source_cn":"你们在梦境里就算争吵也不会受伤，这很和平。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC164BD1131B5130","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1660218023:1":{"text":"저희는 이 꿈을 지키겠어요. 반드시!","source_cn":"我们会守护这场梦境，绝对！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF46452D2408B9D03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1660218024:1":{"text":"이 꿈은 절대 깰 수 없어요. 반드시!","source_cn":"这场梦境不能被破坏，绝对！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C1C9C26019BEE94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:30:0:1":{"text":"이 꿈을 부숴서 모두를 깨울 거야","source_cn":"我要破除梦境，让大家醒过来","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA8A7614E26DFB6E1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이 꿈을 부숴서 모두를 깨울 거야","female":"이 꿈을 부숴서 모두를 깨울 거야","variant_male_record_index":"87117